  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報375期-編輯室ê話"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">民主、美麗ê台灣，需要lán做伙守護。大罷免行動，tih-beh到第三階段，〈罷免心頭定〉、〈台灣人ê媽祖，台灣人ê罷免〉，講出lán ê心聲。〈舊情綿綿——對硓𥑮ê siàu念〉、〈Hōo我tsiânn siàu念ê旅遊——台南龍崎〉講出lán在地ê人情kah智慧。過去，台灣人失台語教育，無法度用母語表達，〈芋圓字典，hōo你學台語學bē siān〉ê講者有真深ê體會。Lán對台灣語言、文化智識ê追求，無應該受著年歲ê制限，就親像〈40歲ê研究所菜鳥仔〉、〈聽〈阿母的話〉tsit首歌ê感動〉兩位老爸「終身學習」ê精神。熱天到，lán歇熱無歇學，基金會主辦ê基北北桃台語家庭意識培力講座、輸入法研習（參考雜誌第25、30、31頁），邀請逐家來參與！</span></p><div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEigq0pS4NL4TmS19cqKNmMyHRiunGiCtrf4CugDtTWdRsaXj7WBeTnvFcpYIJN037ZdwqdLouN52QvPsPfgppj9grdQ3kAHppPWawZWDRplW9taDO1jS93HoXSSCy96aNNnt4HZIiX0CmAExJjEs9uTdzoBv-XGp0jZ47j32NXA_zr10RNMY8Gg5cvFEPJ6/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1375%E6%9C%9F_%E7%9B%AE%E9%8C%84.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEigq0pS4NL4TmS19cqKNmMyHRiunGiCtrf4CugDtTWdRsaXj7WBeTnvFcpYIJN037ZdwqdLouN52QvPsPfgppj9grdQ3kAHppPWawZWDRplW9taDO1jS93HoXSSCy96aNNnt4HZIiX0CmAExJjEs9uTdzoBv-XGp0jZ47j32NXA_zr10RNMY8Gg5cvFEPJ6/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1375%E6%9C%9F_%E7%9B%AE%E9%8C%84.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><br /><div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhIuaSdlmgdvV_xciGgHZJZrA6OhdzFJwQgLG4doSlBEyKhJDZ_-iZWwh1rn2Zro2phTTB_ry6vPDAD1kIjL5Dw7-MvUgUJgwUp1TqXCQzDS1ZHIWMSF7OCm6MwC0iHd4-VuBiNQ2LZynD7V97S8o4or4RpOt1IAng8H_PDX_z3KCMLv5UPO6NuHtD